<!-- Two bare boughs on the #pricing/#founder seam, each growing in from beyond its edge of the screen and
     tapering to the centre, where the tips pass over each other so the line has no gap. The storm lantern
     hangs from the left one; a smaller, dimmer jack-o'-lantern sits on the right one, with a bat under it. A zero-height sibling of the section rather than a child: #founder clips its
     overflow, and the boughs and the light have to spill up into #pricing.
     One 3000x120 box, centred on the viewport at 1:1 (x=1500 is the centre, y=60 the seam): narrow
     viewports simply crop more of the thick bases (body is overflow-x:hidden). Under x 930..1108, where
     the lantern hangs at every desktop width (--hook-x in founder.css), the left bough's underside is flat
     at y~58, so the hook meets it wherever it lands. Bough and twig paths come from tools/boughs.mjs. -->
